  Q1  IS 13 Hz A FLOOR?   lowest within-target sd 4.8 Hz at zero delay,
      against 12.5 at the derived gain 0.00100
      -> NOT A FLOOR. Every earlier arm ran at ONE gain, so the two-level
         statistic was a property of the protocol, not of the larynx.

